.TH "RAPTOR-OPTIMISE" 1 "2026-10" "RAPTOR Studio" "RAPTOR Studio Manual"
.SH NAME
raptor\-optimise \- Simulate the analytic spare\-stock path with common random numbers and recommend the cheapest point whose lower confidence bound meets the target. The model file is only changed with \-\-apply.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBraptor optimise\fR [\-h] WHAT ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Simulate the analytic spare\-stock path with common random numbers and recommend the cheapest point whose lower confidence bound meets the target. The model file is only changed with \-\-apply.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBraptor\fR(1)
